      { "id": "cln", "left": "s.clone()", "right": "A deep copy with its own owner" }
    ],
    "order": ["mut", "cln", "own", "shr"],
    "explain": "Owning, borrowing and copying are the three ways to hand a `String` around. `&` reads, `&mut` changes, `clone()` duplicates."
